From 05281af2c00dfa2242f14d05c2e73078a90fec8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:23:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] estuary: six strings of the player information that nothing
 uses

Written for earlier designs of the player information, and used by
nothing in the skin, the code, the tools or system/ (git grep of every
text file but the .po files): 32752 "more pages", 32753 "Change output
for this video...", 32774 "Link", 32802 (the legend of the levels in one
line), 32816 "Composer (bits BL/EL/out, maps Y/Cb/Cr)" and 32820 "Cache
and queues". Out of the four languages of Hades.
---
 .../resource.language.en_gb/strings.po        | 36 -------------------
 .../resource.language.es_ar/strings.po        | 36 -------------------
 .../resource.language.es_es/strings.po        | 36 -------------------
 .../resource.language.es_mx/strings.po        | 36 -------------------
 4 files changed, 144 deletions(-)

